  "goodToKnow": "Geographisch (or geografisch) means geographical: die geographische Lage (geographical position). Germany's geographische Mitte (geographical centre) is marked in Thuringia. Geographisch gesehen means geographically speaking. From die Geographie. Geographisch liegt Deutschland mitten in Europa, which is why it has so many neighbours. Geographische Namen are place names."
